                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "First of all, If you don't like reading games, then skip this one. If you like these kind of games, then good luck with finding out what the game want to tell you! English isn't my first language, and that makes it a lot harder to understand the text. The grammatical errors are largly present,  an dslow the pace of the game very much down.\n\nBesides this, there is no tutorial, so you have to find out what the game want from you. The cases you get are interesting, bust its very short based. I'd like to see more \"hearing\" of the persons you have in front of you, not just reading one sentence.\n\nHopefully it will be further developed, because it has a lot of potential, but on this moment I won't recommend it.",
